  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhance strategic direction, coordination, and peacebuilding impact of PBF portfolio in Sierra Leone</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the project is to ensure improved coordination, quality, oversight, monitoring and evaluation and strategic communications of the PBF portfolio in Sierra Leone, including by ensuring gender and human rights&#x2019; mainstreaming in the portfolio, by establishing a PBF Secretariat within the UN Resident Coordinator&#x2019;s Office (RCO) and supporting the Office of the High Commissioner for Human Rights (OHCHR) to deploy a Senior Human Rights Advisor (SHRA) to the RCO.</narrative>
  </description>
